860 0 obj
  << /ActualText (Yeslend Project \nNext\056js\054 Payload CMS\054 UI\057UX Design\nDeveloped the UI\057UX design and built the website for Yeslend\054 a financial services platform offering personal\054 mortgage\054 and business loans\056 The platform integrates with multiple financial institutions to streamline loan applications\056\n\n      KEY CONTRIBUITIONS\nUI\057UX Design\072\240Created a user\055friendly interface to enhance customer engagement and simplify loan application processes\056\nWebsite Development\072\240Built the website using Next\056js\054 ensuring a responsive and efficient user experience\056\nContent Management System \050CMS\051\072\240Integrated Payload CMS to manage content efficiently\054 enhancing the platform\047s flexibility and scalability\056)
     /K [ 10 ]
