866 0 obj
  << /ActualText (KEY CONTRIBUITIONS\nResidential Development at NKIL 6563\054 Kai Tak Area 1L\054 Site 2 Kai Tak\054   Kowloon \174 Aug 2020 \055 Nov 2021\n\nDesigned two 39\055storey towers and four 8\055storey houses\nDeveloped ETABS\054 SAFE\054 and SADS models for superstructure\054 wind calculation\054 and RC \050reinforced concrete\051 designs\056\nAssist in daily project activities coordination with clients\054 architects\054 contractors\054 and other consultants\056\n\nResidential Development at NKIL 6554\054 Kai Tak Area 4A\054 Site 2 Kai Tak\054 Kowloon  \174 Mar 2021 \055 Nov 2021\n\nImplemented ETABS\054 SAFE\054 and SADS models to design the superstructure\054 optimize transfer plates\054 and perform wind and RC \050reinforced concrete\051 analyses for a residential project featuring four 30\055storey high\055rise towers and an 8\055storey clubhouse)
     /K [ 13 ]
